<subpara id="X39400000RC01TC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D7L00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0351/14 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.1) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0352/15 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.2) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0353/15 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.3) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0354/14 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.4) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0355/14 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.5) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If DTC P0356/15 is displayed, inspect the ignition coil assembly (cylinder No.6) circuit.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. The freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The following shows the inspection procedure for cylinder No.1. If a malfunction occurs in a cylinder other than cylinder No.1, refer to the following procedure and inspect the circuit of the relevant cylinder.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RC01TC_14" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000RC01TC_14_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FPL00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Check DTC Output</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and check the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="5.97in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.11in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 of P0351/14, P0352/15, P0353/15, P0354/14, P0355/14, P0356/15 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>More than one of P0351/14, P0352/15, P0353/15, P0354/14, P0355/14, P0356/15 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RC01TC_14_0013" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000RC01TC_14_0019" fin="false">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RC01TC_14_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FPM00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and clear the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000008YS014X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RC01TC_14_0014" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RC01TC_14_0014" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FPN00000">
<testtitle>Perform Operation Check Drive</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Change the position of ignition coil NO.1 (cylinder No.1) and perform a road test.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Do not change the position of the ignition coil connectors.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and check the DTCs following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.14in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.99in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC does not change</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A different igniter system DTC is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The DTC judgment can be confirmed using the [Diagnosis Judgment Result Check] function of SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000008YS014X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RC01TC_14_0015" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000RC01TC_14_0022" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RC01TC_14_0015" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FPO00000">
